## 📋 8 Pre-Built npm Scripts

All in `package.json`:

```
npm test                      ← All tests, headless, serial
npm run test:headed           ← All tests, headed, serial
npm run test:parallel         ← All tests, headless, 4 workers
npm run test:parallel:headed  ← All tests, headed, 4 workers
npm run test:tags             ← @smoke tests, headless, serial
npm run test:tags:headed      ← @smoke tests, headed, serial
npm run test:tags:parallel    ← @smoke tests, headless, 4 workers
npm run test:tags:parallel:headed ← @smoke tests, headed, 4 workers
```

